    "bio": "ai researcher | dm open",
    "text": "SpaceXAI engineer Lauren Tan:\n\n\"You can't spawn a hundred agents when you don't even trust the output of one agent\"\n\n\"If you don't have a verification skill, you are the verifier. You're the bottleneck\"\n\nIn a 1-hour talk, she shows how she went from watching every output to shipping 1,000 PRs in a month\n\nWatch every step → Verify → Skills → Evals → Auto-merge\n\nTrust in agents is not a feeling. It's infrastructure you build\n\nWorth more than any $2,000 AI coding bootcamp\n\nBookmark it and watch it tonight",
